    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You unleash a beam of antillurgic energy from your fingertips in a sizzling 120-foot line. Each creature in the line must attempt a Reflex save against 9d12 electricity damage.</p><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and its highest-rank spell slot is lost.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but double damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The electricity damage increases by 1d12.</p>"
